  "description": "This is not the recommended package for working with Networksecurity, please use the Google.Cloud.NetworkSecurity.V1Beta1 package.\n      This Google APIs Client Library for working with Networksecurity v1beta1 uses older code generation, and is harder to use.\n\n      Product documentation is available at:\n      https://cloud.google.com/networking\n\n      API reference documentation for this package is available at:\n      https://googleapis.dev/dotnet/Google.Apis.NetworkSecurity.v1beta1/latest/api/Google.Apis.NetworkSecurity.v1beta1.html\n\n      The source code for this package is available at:\n      https://github.com/google/google-api-dotnet-client/tree/master/Src/Generated/Google.Apis.NetworkSecurity.v1beta1\n\n      Supported Platforms:\n      - .NET Framework 4.6.2+\n      - .NET Standard 2.0\n      - .NET 6.0+\n\n      Incompatible platforms:\n      - .NET Framework < 4.6.2\n      - Silverlight\n      - UWP (will build, but is known not to work at runtime)\n      - Xamarin/MAUI\n      - Windows 8 Apps\n      - Windows Phone 8.1\n      - Windows Phone Silverlight 8.0",
